          修丽可
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          晓姿
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          舒科思
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          池井上
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          杏枝山
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          ISOV
        </div>
        <div class="list-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          ANOTHER FACE
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-title-container">
        <div class="pill-label" style="display: inline-block;">推荐品项</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          修丽可瀑布水疗
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          池井上轻盈水嫩管理
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          池井上问题肌管理
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
          <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="8 12 11 15 16 9"></polyline></svg>
          高利润仪器品项
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-title-container">
        <div class="pill-label" style="display: inline-block;">推荐理由</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reason-text">
        因店铺非临街商铺，所以线上流量尤为重要，必须做好线上客群，因此可以凭借各种大牌的品牌影响力带动流量，需要大量的流量爆款皮肤护理品项拓客，问题性肌肤解决刚需皮肤问题，做盈利品项部分！
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-container">
      <div class="footer-pill">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg>
